Sucks that you lost your magic cloak.  Remember, while you hold Magic Bane
in your hands (I think you have to weild it), it also protects you from
magic.  Don't put it down!!!  The Amulet of Life Saving protected you from
"YASD" or "YALearningExperience" - be happy you can keep playing this
character :)  You lost some nice stuff, but it's certainly not the end of
the world!  Just remember that you can't even eat a Wraith corpse after
eating a dragon :-p  (I lost a Wizard who was just about to go toe-to-toe
with the Wizard....), and *sometimes* you don't even get the question
"stop eating?" before choking to death - if you've just eaten a dragon,
then you're soooooooo full that one mouthfull is too much...  Be careful
eating while satiated!

